comment15.text=\r\n\ Verifies\ if\ a\ row\ and\ column\ are\ within\ the\ board\ limits.\r\n\ \r\n\ @param\ row\ Row\ to\ be\ verified.\r\n\ @param\ column\ Column\ to\ be\ verified.\r\n\ @return\ true\ if\ the\ row\ and\ column\ are\ within\ the\ limits,\ false\ otherwise.\r\n
